# Factorio mod files

## Required / expected

- `info.json`: `name`, `version` (`X.Y.Z`), `title`, `author`, `factorio_version` (`"2.1"`), `description`, `dependencies`
- `changelog.txt`: official Factorio changelog format (99 dashes, `Version:`, optional `Date:`, categories, `    - ` entries)
- `locale/en/*.cfg` and `locale/ru/*.cfg` for player-facing strings
- `README.md` (EN) + `README_RU.md` when documenting a mod
- Optional: `changelog_RU.txt` mirroring EN changelog in Russian (repo/docs only; game reads `changelog.txt`)

## Do not

- Use recipe `category` / `additional_categories` — Factorio 2.1 requires `categories = { "..." }`
- Put tabs or trailing spaces in `changelog.txt`
- Ship secrets, `.cursor/`, or pack-only junk inside portal zips

## Packaging / portal

- Build zips: `scripts/pack-mod.ps1` or `scripts/pack-mod.py`
- Publish/update: `scripts/publish-mod.py` or workflow `.github/workflows/publish-mods.yml`
- See skill `factorio-mod-packaging`
